"\n"
"*otherwise,* if you did not expect to receive this, you can simply ignore this invitation or report it.\n"
"\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"*Before accepting, we encourage you to review our [Moderator Guidelines](/help/moderatorguidelines) to understand the expectations and responsibilities of being a moderator.*"
